  "name": "done-required-full-test-gate",
  "title": "Implement DONE-required full-test validation gate",
  "description": "Implement the runtime gate described by docs/requirements/decisions/done-full-test-gate-execution-plan.md. The verified B-3321 gap is that local DONE currently consumes ordinary lattice validate evidence only; when validate.commands is configured, root full npm test can sit outside DONE proof. Add an opt-in DONE-required validation policy/evidence path so self-host can require a fresh packages/main build plus root npm test before DONE, while external projects without policy remain advisory. This is a high-risk lifecycle gate change and must preserve routine validate speed, evidence freshness, process-fact registration, and 3 round / 2 host review requirements.",
